WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.103
Open the Order List.

2
00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:07.155
Lines waiting for you are in the approval queue.

3
00:00:07.255 --> 00:00:12.755
Tap Approve.

4
00:00:14.004 --> 00:00:19.504
When you have placed the order, tap Mark ordered.

5
00:00:29.149 --> 00:00:33.020
The line moves to Ordered.
